docs {
  # Search Tools
  
  Search for tools by name or description using case-insensitive pattern matching.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  - `q` (required): Search query string (1-255 characters)
  
  ## Examples
  
  Search by name:
  ```
  GET {{server}}/tools/search?q=user
  ```
  
  Search by description:
  ```
  GET {{server}}/tools/search?q=cost
  ```
  
  Case-insensitive search:
  ```
  GET {{server}}/tools/search?q=AWS
  GET {{server}}/tools/search?q=aws
  ```
  
  Partial matching:
  ```
  GET {{server}}/tools/search?q=cust
  ```
}
